{"id":"el-final-tmdb-1422011","type":"MOVIE","category":"CINE","title":"El final","overview":"Un grupo de recién graduados sale a dar un paseo nocturno en busca de comida, con la esperanza de disfrutar de una última noche juntos antes de que sus caminos se separen. Amontonados en un Jeep Cherokee, acabarán adentrándose en un infierno interminable de dos carriles, rodeado de horrores incalculables y fuerzas cósmicas inexplicables. Un ingenioso debut que utiliza una pesadillesca carretera sin fin para hablar de la espeluznante transición a la edad adulta.","releaseDate":"2026-10-15","posterUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ifMur4sjsVUmtJMxOS6gsLrsQpx.jpg","backdropUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/9Wf1xwPOycnxvdVnpr6Di381Zf.jpg","genres":["Terror","Misterio"],"originalLanguage":"en","spokenLanguages":["English"],"images":[{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/9Wf1xwPOycnxvdVnpr6Di381Zf.jpg","label":"Escena 01"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/4oPUinF3kg64y2RGH3JkZevVF5r.jpg","label":"Escena 02"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/92go2eC1XB8RIf0uLy844ruxB9L.jpg","label":"Escena 03"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/tMcdOpssdNMnUBZLVkCLRKUNMET.jpg","label":"Escena 04"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/pYMTv7MSRRgVCDJrqHAmdRzIDAA.jpg","label":"Escena 05"}],"ratings":{"tmdb":5.7},"availability":{},"cast":[{"name":"Phinehas Yoon","role":"James","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4QPjUk5XRcK31hq5sfeuS1MjL1I.jpg","personTmdbId":4004128,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"Akira Jackson","role":"Day","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6rTQ373bfj3TvPigeciCqteEPZg.jpg","personTmdbId":5197161,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"Noah Toth","role":"Fisher","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cj6dL9qUnrSVOlaQBOvLiGzjdEk.jpg","personTmdbId":2973589,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"Mitchell Cole","role":"Tyler","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zsnkkaOPiBgLmQODpAE8GBcE0YT.jpg","personTmdbId":3830116,"department":"A